{"id":"725681f54d4cc140","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-halt-notation.md","title":"Halting Notation","display":"df-halt-notation — Halting Notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-halt-notation","aliases":["90-df-halt-notation"],"display":"df-halt-notation — Halting Notation","depends_on":["[[90-df-t-predicate]]","[[90-df-partial-function]]","[[90-df-program-numbering]]","[[90-df-machine-coding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-halt-notation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-halt-notation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-halt-notation — Halting Notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"48b1cea94ba27d41\" href=\"?note=48b1cea94ba27d41\" title=\"90-df-t-predicate\">90-df-t-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"01ab533da9c8c517\" href=\"?note=01ab533da9c8c517\" title=\"90-df-machine-coding\">90-df-machine-coding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-halt-notation-—-Halting-Notation-($\\downarrow$)\">df-halt-notation — Halting Notation (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\downarrow\">\\(\\downarrow\\)</span>)</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,s,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,x,s,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e,\\varphi_{e,s}^{(1)}\">\\(\\varphi_e,\\varphi_{e,s}^{(1)}\\)</span> 与部分值记号由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a> 定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_1\">\\(T_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"48b1cea94ba27d41\" href=\"?note=48b1cea94ba27d41\" title=\"90-df-t-predicate\">90-df-t-predicate</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists y\\ T_1(e,x,y),\\\\\n\\varphi_e(x)\\uparrow&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists y\\ T_1(e,x,y),\\\\\n\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists y\\ (T_1(e,x,y)\\land U(y)=n),\\\\\n\\varphi_{e,s}&amp;:=\\varphi_{e,s}^{(1)},\\qquad\n\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists s\\ \\varphi_{e,s}(x)\\downarrow.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists y\\ T_1(e,x,y),\\\\\n\\varphi_e(x)\\uparrow&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists y\\ T_1(e,x,y),\\\\\n\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists y\\ (T_1(e,x,y)\\land U(y)=n),\\\\\n\\varphi_{e,s}&amp;:=\\varphi_{e,s}^{(1)},\\qquad\n\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists s\\ \\varphi_{e,s}(x)\\downarrow.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 界定见证代码而非必须恰好执行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 个机器步；这不影响并集或收敛等价式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\uparrow\">\\(\\uparrow\\)</span> 不表示值域中新添的对象，而表示该输入不属于部分函数的定义域。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-halt-notation-—-Halting-Notation-($\\downarrow$)","text":"df-halt-notation — Halting Notation ($\\downarrow$)","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-t-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"48b1cea94ba27d41","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-t-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"e860bc8bff2a4e39","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-machine-coding","status":"resolved","id":"01ab533da9c8c517","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-machine-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$e,x,s,n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\varphi_e,\\varphi_{e,s}^{(1)}$ 与部分值记号由 [[90-df-program-numbering]] 定义，$T_1$ 见 [[90-df-t-predicate]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-t-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"48b1cea94ba27d41","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$e,x,s,n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\varphi_e,\\varphi_{e,s}^{(1)}$ 与部分值记号由 [[90-df-program-numbering]] 定义，$T_1$ 见 [[90-df-t-predicate]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\downarrow","display":false},{"tex":"e,x,s,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e,\\varphi_{e,s}^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"T_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow&\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists y\\ T_1(e,x,y),\\\\\n\\varphi_e(x)\\uparrow&\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\exists y\\ T_1(e,x,y),\\\\\n\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow=n&\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists y\\ (T_1(e,x,y)\\land U(y)=n),\\\\\n\\varphi_{e,s}&:=\\varphi_{e,s}^{(1)},\\qquad\n\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists s\\ \\varphi_{e,s}(x)\\downarrow.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"\\uparrow","display":false}],"bytes":1227,"backlinks":[{"id":"3e426ba53e1b66a0","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$c\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1$ 是满足 $\\forall e,x\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\varphi_{c(e)}(x)\\downarrow=e$ 的常量程序编译器；下降等号见 [[90-df-halt-notation]]。"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-program-numbering]]、[[90-df-halt-notation]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonalization.md]]\n[[90-df-divisibility.md]]\n[[90-df-divrem-function.md]]\n[[90-df-effective-procedure.md]]\n[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[90-df-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-df-factorial-function.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point-theorem.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point.md]]\n[[90-df-formula.md]